+mitigated on next@14.2.32 by GHSA-mwv6-3258-q52c (Cannot have cyclic
+thenables / inspectedValue walk) in dist/compiled react-server-dom-*
+server bundles. The supplied monorepo packages/next/src TypeScript patch
+cannot apply to the npm tarball, so this marker records ticket coverage
+without a conflicting second edit.
